This module is original work, but two external sources shaped it.

## HyperIsland (MIT)

Hook scaffolding, the libxposed module layout (`META-INF/xposed/{java_init.list,module.prop,scope.list}`),
the remote-preferences configuration channel, and the "companion app writes prefs, SystemUI reads
them" pattern were informed by reading HyperIsland by 芥子 (1812z), licensed MIT:

