Copyright (c) the HyperIsland authors. MIT licence text: https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT

No HyperIsland source file is included, and none of its HyperOS-specific hook targets are used —
this module does not touch `miui.systemui.dynamicisland.*`, which does not exist on ColorOS.

## realme C67 / ColorOS SystemUI (proprietary — measurements only)

Island proportions and behaviour were derived by reading the shipped `SystemUI.apk` of a
realme C67 (RMX3890, `RMX3890export_15.C.52`), which is proprietary OPPO/realme software.

What was taken is arithmetic and physical facts, all of which are independently measurable:

- cutout geometry on a 1080x2400 panel: 76x100 px centred at x=540
- capsule height 36dp at density 540 = 121.5 px; base width 208dp = 702 px
- status-bar row depth equals the cutout depth

No class, method, resource, layout, drawable, or animation asset from that APK is present in this
repository, and none may be added. The expand/collapse choreography is designed here.
